+| macOS | `amd64`, `arm64` | `.pkg`, `.tar.gz` | Package: `/usr/local/go`; PATH file: `/etc/paths.d/go` |
+| Windows | `386`, `amd64`, `arm64` | `.msi`, `.zip` | MSI: `Program Files` or `Program Files (x86)`; x64 normally `C:\Program Files\Go` |
