+| `/Users/iv/.goenv/shims/go` | Dispatches to goenv 1.25.5 | 411-byte shell script; SHA-256 `968637fd94b7020b751cb5dc2669c160f3451bd0e1af03d50a011a917472b8fb` | Reject wrapper |
